;custom code
@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K14()
CALL CHARA_TEXT(14, nameArray:14:na_Title, "l")
PRINTL 
PRINTFORMDL An ice fairy who lives around the Misty Lake, serving as something of a leader to the other fairies there.
PRINTFORMDL Headstrong and curious, she frequently gets herself into trouble all over Gensokyo.
PRINTFORMDL No matter how many times her antics come to a regrettable end for her, she always enthusiastically throws herself into the next scheme.
PRINTFORMD Her favorite hobby is to freeze frogs and watch them thaw in the water, 
SELECTCASE ABL:[[チルノ]]:戦闘能力
    CASE IS >= 6
        PRINTFORMDL executing it with meticulous precision, ensuring no harm comes to them.
    CASE 5
        PRINTFORMDL but around one in twenty attempts fail, and the frog shatters into pieces.
    CASE 4
        PRINTFORMDL but around one in ten attempts fail, and the frog shatters into pieces.
    CASE 3
        PRINTFORMDL but around one in six attempts fail, and the frog shatters into pieces.
    CASE 2
        PRINTFORMDL but around one in four attempts fail, and the frog shatters into pieces.
    CASE 1
        PRINTFORMDL but around one in three attempts fail, and the frog shatters into pieces.
ENDSELECT

PRINTL
IF !CFLAG:[[チルノ]]:1101
    PRINTFORMDL Proclaiming herself to be the "strongest", she is quick to challenge others to a fight, no matter how strong they may seem.
ELSE
    PRINTFORMDL After a humiliating defeat at your hands, she declared herself to be your rival, determined to become strong enough to defeat you in a fight.

    IF CFLAG:[[チルノ]]:1103
        PRINTFORMDL She seems to have mellowed out significantly after your last decisive match, accepting the position of second strongest after you.
    ELSE
        SELECTCASE ABL:[[チルノ]]:戦闘能力
            CASE 6
                PRINTFORMDL Whenever you see her, she is brimming with confidence and eager to decide who the true strongest is in a proper rematch.
            CASE 5
                PRINTFORMDL You often see her in Danmaku matches with many opponents at once, masterfully controlling the battlefield to pick them off one by one.
            CASE 4
                PRINTFORMDL You often see her in Danmaku matches with powerful youkai, who struggle to keep up with her.
            CASE 3
                PRINTFORMDL You often see her in Danmaku matches with various youkai, applying various new strategies to her matches.
            CASE 2
                PRINTFORMDL You often see her in Danmaku matches with minor youkai, showing rapid improvement.
            CASE 1
                PRINTFORMDL You often see her in Danmaku matches with other fairies, which usually go in her favor.
        ENDSELECT
    ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1
